From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:32:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 74/91] Site and mission fixes

- Signature slots no longer go to site types the system has no dungeon for.
- A system keeps at most 1 wandering wormhole of its own (2 in w-space).
- Systems unload gridUnloadTime seconds after the last pilot leaves, as the
  config says. Before, it was about a minute after the 5 minute update.
  Jump stamps are uint32 now; uint16 wrapped after 18 hours.
- Systems with a mission pocket in them stay loaded until the mission is over.
- NPCs and structures placed in a dungeon room keep their objectID, so the
  triggers on them fire. Caldari Beacons, Hidden Enemy Base, Sansha
  Acquisition and Terrorism! can be completed now. A Large Collidable
  Structure no longer counts as a hostile the room has to be cleared of.
- 16 missions get their client title (chain parts and names spelled
  differently on eve-survival). Migration 20261022130000-mission-titles.sql.
